# Toolchain pins for asdf / mise. Exact patch versions on purpose: a floating
# major is what lets one machine build on Node 18 and another on Node 24.
#
# Node is the one that actually bites — Vite 7 and Vitest 4 fail on Node 18 in
# ways that read as test failures rather than as an environment problem. Keep
# this version in lockstep with /.nvmrc and frontend/package.json's
# engines.node, and the Maven version in lockstep with
# backend/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties.
#
# Java/Maven are also enforced at build time by the Maven Enforcer rules in
# backend/pom.xml, so a developer without asdf/mise still cannot build on the
# wrong JDK. The Java plugin name below is asdf-java's ("temurin-<version>");
# mise accepts the same string.
nodejs 22.23.3
maven 3.9.11
java temurin-25.0.4.1+1
